===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The collective property and liabilities of someone, especially a deceased person. {{defdate|from 19th c.}}
# {{lb|en|now|_|rare|archaic}} [[state|State]]; [[condition]]. {{defdate|from 13th c.}}
